  "content": "<p data-pid=\"50sTMxxx\">入宅十年，以前看动画就是为了消遣时间，现在是边消遣时间边学日语：</p><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FeGo68E2a/\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"[学日语] 无阻沉浸ゆるゆり３ (2026-05-25)_哔哩哔哩_bilibili\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">[学日语] 无阻沉浸ゆるゆり３ (2026-05-25)_哔哩哔哩_bilibili</a><p data-pid=\"sTvDCF63\">目前已经看了 28 部生肉：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9abca4f3bad78d0c648c64469722b01e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1810\" data-rawheight=\"1610\" data-original-token=\"v2-9abca4f3bad78d0c648c64469722b01e\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1810\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-9abca4f3bad78d0c648c64469722b01e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1810&#39; height=&#39;1610&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1810\" data-rawheight=\"1610\" data-original-token=\"v2-9abca4f3bad78d0c648c64469722b01e\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1810\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-9abca4f3bad78d0c648c64469722b01e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9abca4f3bad78d0c648c64469722b01e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"B3muU47a\">查了一万多个词，背了五千多个：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8941b213a428c5f9ca631cdba2b4a941_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2542\" data-rawheight=\"2686\" data-original-token=\"v2-8941b213a428c5f9ca631cdba2b4a941\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2542\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8941b213a428c5f9ca631cdba2b4a941_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2542&#39; height=&#39;2686&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2542\" data-rawheight=\"2686\" data-original-token=\"v2-8941b213a428c5f9ca631cdba2b4a941\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2542\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8941b213a428c5f9ca631cdba2b4a941_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8941b213a428c5f9ca631cdba2b4a941_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"bACXj3fA\">学日语的方法参考的是外网著名日语学习社区 The Moe Way，其理念就是<b>「通过你热爱的事物来学习」</b>：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2005777505055967011\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"日语学习：萌萌二次元之路\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-62ee5a7955e0500d683f8200ad3f3364.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">日语学习：萌萌二次元之路</a><p data-pid=\"fJEq8Z6G\">本人体感的番剧难度排名，同一个 rank 内的不分先后：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-afbcb251a94db56090f2598baf9c7f32_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1200\" data-rawheight=\"3882\" data-original-token=\"v2-afbcb251a94db56090f2598baf9c7f32\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1200\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-afbcb251a94db56090f2598baf9c7f32_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1200&#39; height=&#39;3882&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1200\" data-rawheight=\"3882\" data-original-token=\"v2-afbcb251a94db56090f2598baf9c7f32\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1200\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-afbcb251a94db56090f2598baf9c7f32_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-afbcb251a94db56090f2598baf9c7f32_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"1nhyoKAv\">标注网站：</p><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//jiten.moe/\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"Jiten - Vocabulary Lists and Anki Decks for Japanese Media - Jiten\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Jiten - Vocabulary Lists and Anki Decks for Japanese Media - Jiten</a><p></p>",
